# Git Push on Update

After making any code changes, updates, or additions to this project:

1. Stage the relevant files
2. Commit with a clear message (e.g. `feat: ...`, `fix: ...`)
3. Push to GitHub (`git push`)

Do this automatically at the end of each editing session when changes were made. Skip if no files were modified.
